---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | LeeScoop" description="About LeeScoop, a simple local guide to what’s happening around Lee County.">
  <Header />
  <main class="wrap page-shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Your scoop on Lee County.</h1>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="panel-glow homepage-section">
      <p class="lede">
        LeeScoop is a simple place to find short local updates around Lee County, organized by city and area.
      </p>
      <p class="lede small-note">
        No ads. No promotion. Just what’s happening in your area.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-sidebar-grid homepage-section">
      <article class="panel-glow">
        <p class="eyebrow">Operating rules</p>
        <ul class="signal-list compact">
          <li><strong>Local</strong><span>Organized around Lee County cities and locations.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Brief</strong><span>Updates should be short enough to scan quickly.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Kind</strong><span>The tone should be helpful, calm, and neighborly.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Static</strong><span>The site stays simple, fast, and Cloudflare Pages friendly.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="panel-glow">
        <p class="eyebrow">Publishing style</p>
        <p class="lede small-note">
          Markdown stays the source of truth. Pagefind handles search. Cloudflare Pages handles hosting. No database or live app server is needed for v1.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
